 and make videos consistently  another thing is you should try to learn  how to edit your own videos develop your  own style and then hire an editor so  that you can tell them exactly how you  want it to be edited  and you know exactly like how long it's  gonna take how in your opinion do you  think canadian architecture compares to  the rest of the world  i'm actually gonna make a separate video  on this so stay tuned  have you or do you intend to work on  international projects i have not worked  on an international project yet but it  is one of the reasons why i joined the  firm that i'm at right now which is a uk  firm  with their satellite office in vancouver  and so  the uk base definitely does tons of  projects all over europe and the world  there's quite a lot of crossover between  um our office so  definitely hopefully i'll get to work on  some international projects what's your  favorite architecture place  since you said place not a particular  building i'm gonna say venice is my  favorite place i love going there and  just like walking around the labyrinth  and alleys without like any particular  destination or like looking at the map  and you're just like transported into a  completely different world and  it's quiet and mysterious  and i just love that feeling of getting  lost in the city thank you for joining  guys for this part two of the q a i hope  you found it interesting or at least  entertaining if you are interested in  some of my other videos that actually  have a topic i have videos on  presentation techniques videos where i  talk about creativity i'll leave it in  the description if you want to check it  out if you have any follow-up questions  or further comments just leave it in the  comment section if you are interested in  seeing more videos  and you are not subscribed to the  channel please subscribe i have some  good content coming out every week  possibly even twice a week if you  enjoyed this video please give me a  thumbs up and i'll see you guys in the  next video bye  [Music]
 

